abstract: >-
  A reproducible research testbed for action authorization under uncertain,
  dependent, stale, conflicting, and potentially compromised evidence, with
  synthetic controller evaluation, provenance stress tests, and a frozen
  real-model follow-up protocol.
keywords:
  - AI safety
  - agent governance
  - evidence gating
  - verification
  - provenance
  - autonomous agents
